ministration School of Education School of Indigenous Relations School of Kinesiology and Health Sciences School of Liberal Arts School of Natural Sciences School of Nursing School of Social Sciences School of Social Work School of Speech-Language Pathology School of Sports Administration Close Services Our services and support are here to help you succeed in your studies and experience university life to the fullest. View all services Menu Parking Residence myLaurentian Hub Academic Support International Students Services Athletics and Campus Rec Campus Life Doing Business with Laurentian Equity, Diversity and Human Rights Health and Wellbeing Academic Support Academic Advising Accessibility Services Bookstore Indigenous Student Affairs Library & Archives myLaurentianHub Peer Programs Research Services The Virtual Backpack Jim Fielding Innovation & Commercialization Space International Students Services Current International Students Newly Admitted International Students Health Insurance Work in Canada Study in Canada Outgoing Exchange Students Incoming Exchange Students Travel Requirements Athletics and Campus Rec Athletics Campus Recreation Campus Life Apparel Store Campus Safety Clubs Daycare Employment Services Indigenous Student Affairs International Exchange Program IT Services Meal Plans and Eating on Campus Orientation Parking Peer Programs Residence Study Abroad Student Associations Student Equity Centre The Student Success Centre Student Equity Centre Student Equity Centre About Us Events & Initiatives Pride Women's Centre Doing Business with Laurentian Business Services Conference and Event Services Printing Services Equity, Diversity and Human Rights Office of Equity, Diversity and Human Rights Accessibility Policy Anti-Racism & Anti-Hate Black History Month Prevention and Response to Sexual Violence Health and Wellbeing Counselling Laurentian Re-U Free Store Laurentian University Food Bank Medical Clinic Mental Health & Wellness Support Services Speech and Language Clinic Close About Laurentian University Learn about Laurentian University’s mission, leadership, and initiatives. Learn about Laurentian University Menu News Careers Contact Us Campus Maps Governance & Leadership Policies & Accountability Office of Sustainability Facts & Figures News News Social Media Events Student Stories Careers Careers Administrative Vacancies Faculty Vacancies Governance & Leadership Governance & Leadership Board of Governors Chancellor General Counsel LUNEC Leadership Planning President Senate President Listening Tour Policies & Accountability Policies & Accountability Finance and Budget Academic Accountability AODA at Laurentian University Copyright Notice of Collection Policies Policy on the Freedom of Speech Procurement and Contracts Purchasing Policy Office of Sustainability Office of Sustainability Laurentian Greenspace Global Lessons from the Restoration Story of Sudbury, Canada Laurentian's Nature Positive University Close Information for... Menu Future Students Future International Students Current Students Current International Students Faculty & Staff Alumni Parents & Counselors Donors Close Research Learn more about Research at Laurentian University Menu Research Research Centres Research Chairs & Fellows Funding Opportunities Highlights Our People Strategic Research Plan Animal Care and Lab-Bio Safety Equity, Diversity and Inclusion Ethics Intellectual Property & Commercialization Jim Fielding Innovation Space ROMEO Research Data Management Research Support Fund Qualtrics Menu Search Home Services The Student Success Centre Career Hub Career Hub Related Pages Work-Study Program Career Events Employer Resources Job Search About the Career Hub The Career Hub at Laurentian University provides support services and resources for students and recent alumni seeking career-related opportunities. Students and alumni will be supported in developing career-readiness skills and receive professional advice on how to strategically approach their career and employment goals. Services include: Career Advising Workshops and Events Career Resources Job Search Strategies Networking Opportunities Employer Collaboration Email our team at careerhub@laurentian.ca for more information. Get Career Ready Looking for advice on your résumé and cover letter? Book a session with a Career Advisor. Book Now Looking to attend career-related events? Check out our career events calendar for upcoming workshops, fairs, and networking opportunities. Events Calendar Looking for a job? Have a look at our Job Search resources page. Job Resources Career Events Calendar Career Hub Office of Student Success Parker Building, P-227 935 Ramsey Lake Road, Sudbury, ON P3E 2C6 careerhub@laurentian.ca 705-675-1151, ext. 3469 Laurentian University 1.800.461.4030 705.675.1151 935 Ramsey Lake Road, Sudbury, ON P3E 2C6 Contact Us Social Media Visits and Tours Report a problem with the website Are You Okay? Accessibility Services Careers Directories Helpful Contacts News Land Acknowledgment - Aki Gaabijidebendaagwak We would like to acknowledge the Robinson-Huron Treaty of 1850. We also further recognize that Laurentian University is located on the traditional lands of the Atikameksheng Anishnawbek and that the City of Greater Sudbury, also includes the traditional lands of the Wahnapitae First Nation. We extend our deepest respect to Indigenous peoples - as a sign of our continued relationship we will support Laurentian University ’s Truth and Reconciliation Task Force Recommendations. Miigwech. Listen to it in Anishinaabemowin . Privacy Policy Accessibility Policy Sitemap Laurentian University. Sudbury, Ontario, Canada. All Rights Reserved. 2026 Close"
